            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present application provides a digital PCR detection apparatus, a digital PCR quantitative detection method, a multi-volume digital PCR quantitative analysis method, a digital PCR detection method, a nucleic acid detection microsphere, a preparation method of the nucleic acid detection microsphere, a kit, and a high-throughput nucleic acid detection method.</p>
